# Owner keys, the other keys and characters; Esc last.
S START
K DOWN
K ENTER
S ENTER
K F5
S F5
# SHIFT and CTRL change nothing for the owner's key.
K UP
K SHIFT-ENTER
S SENTER
K DOWN
K CTRL-ENTER
S CENTER
# Any other key is the owner's note with its code, SHIFT and CTRL; but
# Right, Left and Shift-Right scroll the columns, which fit here, so they
# move nothing and the title keeps the note before them.
K F1
S F1
K RIGHT
S RIGHT
K INS
S INS
K DEL
S DEL
K BS
S BS
K SPACE
S SPACE
K LEFT
S LEFT
K SHIFT-RIGHT
S SRIGHT
K CTRL-DEL
S CDEL
K CTRL-F5
S CF5
# Characters are dropped: the IDs are left-aligned, so a typed digit would
# find its row if the box took it.
T 3
S CHAR3
T 1
S CHAR1
K HOME
T 2
S CHAR2
T 123
S CHAR123
K F6
S F6ON
K F6
S F6OFF
K ESC
S ESC
